

Papatono whakapai.


>> Veggy := Ahanoa hou.
Veggy ina-tae: ['hou'] mahia: {
	>> v := whaiaro hou.
	v init. <- v.
}.

Veggy ina-tae: ['init'] mahia: { ake veggies := 0. }.

Veggy ina-tae: ['carrots:'] mahia: { :a ake veggies := a. <- Kore. }.
Veggy ina-tae: ['carrots'] mahia: { <- ake veggies. }.
Veggy ina-tae: ['+'] mahia: { :f
	>> n := Veggy hou.
	n carrots: (f carrots + ake veggies). <- n.
}.

Veggy ina-tae: ['aho'] mahia: { <- ake veggies aho.
}.

Tau ina-tae: ['carrots'] mahia: {
	>> x := Veggy hou.
	x carrots: whaiaro. <- x.
}.

Tau ina-tae: ['add:and:'] mahia: { :a :b <- (a + b).
}.

>> q := 0 add: (3 carrots + 2 carrots) and: 4 carrots.
Huaputa tuhi: q, rārangi-hou.
